<title>JAPAN: Olympic Sports shares suspended - JSDA.</title>
<headline>Olympic Sports shares suspended - JSDA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Olympic Sports Co, listed on the over-the-counter market, will be suspended on Friday, the Japan Securities Dealers Association (JSDA) said.  </p>
<p>The JSDA said it suspended Olympic Sports' shares due to the emergence of information which could influence investors' judgement concerning their investment in the company's shares.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available for comment.</p>
</text>
